# The Road to Aht Urhgan (jeuno 91): "Where's Tenzen?" at RoV Inescapable Binds, from the available state's 10063. A
# level 75 Warrior, RoV Inescapable Binds current, Prog 1 by a GM while available: 10063 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1); finished
# 1: not begun (1 is not 2 / 3), but quest:complete runs: completed, the Boarding Permit, the mission completed and
# Desert Winds added. Completed: 10071. (The accepted 10064's: #rov_accepted; a GM cannot set Inescapable Binds current
# again over Desert Winds: addMission refuses to overwrite a current mission.)
lists LowerJeuno/Faursel/onTrigger LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10063 LowerJeuno/onEventFinish/10064
char zone=LowerJeuno pos=39.5,4.1,-45.2 job=WAR lvl=75
mission Rov InescapableBinds current
charvar Quest[3][91]Prog 1
login
trigger Faursel                     # available, Prog 1, the mission: 10063 (0, 0, 0, 0, 0, 1)
finish option=1                     # completed; the Boarding Permit; Inescapable Binds completed, Desert Winds current
trigger Faursel                     # completed: 10071
finish
